# W8-SEEN (writer 8's third pass). E §7 step 1: "Cells that no random fact reaches are computed once and shared by
# every path: ... every plan that no random fact reaches"; E §3.1 step 10 / L §5.16: a line is random only where it
# reaches a random fact. pay books w on a random day; low_v reads v, which only fee books (100.00 DUK on the first of
# each month, opening 0.00 DUK), so q6 is no random line and is answered: the lowest month-end balance is January's
# 100.00 DUK. q8, a query over paths of low_w, still evaluates w per path (L5_16_random_balance_def: 0 of 3). snap9
# refused the load (LOAD-RANDOM the line is random ...): pay's refused day held for the whole main walk.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
source s "s"
index delays = 1..10
place w: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
place v: accounts DUK lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money DUK question "amount?"
version o
  cite s
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[w] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[v] = 0.00 DUK at 2026-01-01 start
  amt = 100.00 DUK governs always "a"
def delay[m in months]: dist = discrete(1 for k in delays)
def low_w: money DUK = min(bal(w, end_of(m) - 1) for m in months)
move pay[m in months]: transfers
  on add_days(start_of(m), delay[m])
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to w amount amt
def low_v: money DUK = min(bal(v, end_of(m) - 1) for m in months)
move fee[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to v amount amt
ask q6: low_v law 2026-12-31
ask q8: share(low_w < amt) law 2026-12-31 paths 3 seed 1
=== expect
q6: 100.00 DUK
  law date 2026-12-31, cut 2026-01-01
q8: 0 of 3, 0 (standard error 0; 3 paths; horizon none)
  law date 2026-12-31, cut 2026-01-01
